  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Heart Catch — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>At 3rd level, your love hands improve. Your hands gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Your hands AC increase by your proficiency bonus  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Your hands gain a damage bonus equal to your CE modifier  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The range of your hands increases to a total of 30 feet  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Grappled creatures are  also restrained  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You can use cursed feats and abilities using your hands</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
